": 0, "char_end": 134, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}]}, "potential_elements": {"textual": [], "visual": [{"element_id": "V001", "observation": "A user is composing an eBay Customer Service contact message with the subject shown as “Selling_eBay guarantee questions.” The visible typed message asks: “When Buyer make eBay Guarantee and if he asked return the payment | how can we return payment ? without taking product ?? Please clarify my doubt Thank you”.", "dimensions": ["money_or_data_flow", "requested_action"], "frame_ids": ["F0035", "F0041", "F0047", "F0053"], "context": "Visible context is an eBay.in Customer Service contact form; the user appears to be asking support a question or reporting uncertainty, not visibly promoting the described action.", "potential_relevance": "The observed message links an eBay Guarantee scenario to a buyer asking for payment to be returned while the seller says the product has not been taken, describing a conditional payment-return situation that may be relevant for reviewing possible dispute or refund-abuse mechanics in context.", "limitations": "The sampled frames do not show the underlying transaction, buyer communication, any actual refund, product shipment/return status, or eBay’s response. The frames also do not establish whether the described situation occurred or whether it is hypothetical."}], "textual_context_notes": [], "visual_context_notes": [{"observation": "The browser shows eBay.in pages, including sign-in, shopping homepage, Customer Service topic selection, contact options, and an email contact form.", "frame_ids": ["F0007", "F0012", "F0018", "F0024", "F0030"]}, {"observation": "After form submission, the page displays: “Your message has been sent to eBay Customer Service. You should receive a response within 24-48 hours.”", "frame_ids": ["F0064"]}]}, "annotation": {"binary_label": "Non-scam", "primary_subtype": "N03", "content_role": "promotion_or_instruction", "contextual_rationale": "This video is non-scam content because it demonstrates how to reach eBay Customer Service and submit a question about an eBay Guarantee. The payment-return language appears within a support inquiry seeking clarification about a conditional situation, rather than as an offer or solicitation to viewers. The sequence ends with confirmation that the message was sent to eBay Customer Service, while no underlying transaction or later response is shown.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The primary content is an operational demonstration of navigating eBay Customer Service and submitting an inquiry through its contact form.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The title identifies the subject as contacting eBay Customer Service.", "source_id": "TITLE_0001", "quote": "how to contact ebay customer service"}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The description states that the video explains how to contact eBay Customer Service.", "source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "quote": "In this video i would like to share about how to contact ebay customer service."}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows an eBay.in Customer Service page with account-related help topics.", "source_id": "F0018", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows eBay Customer Service contact options, including an Email us option.", "source_id": "F0024", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E005", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows a completed support question, a verification-code field, and a Send button on an eBay contact form.", "source_id": "F0053", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E006", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows a confirmation that the message was sent to eBay Customer Service and that a response is expected within 24-48 hours.", "source_id": "F0064", "quote": ""}]}}
